Scope

The MIT license above covers original Episode Desk source code in this
repository, copyright Thomas Jensen. An audit of this repository found no
vendored third-party source, no copied-code notices, and no package
dependencies. The desk uses the Python standard library only. There were
no pre-existing third-party notices to preserve.

This MIT license does not cover:

- Fish Audio Drama 3, or any other Fish Audio material. Drama 3 is used by
  the separate pipeline under the Fish Audio Community License, Version 1.0
  (13 October 2026). That license is not MIT. No Drama 3 weights, codecs,
  or other Fish Audio materials are included in this repository.
  https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/drama-3/blob/main/LICENSE

- VibeVoice software or weights. The Microsoft VibeVoice source repository
  is MIT-licensed (Copyright (c) 2025 Microsoft). That grant was not verified
  for the installed VibeVoice-7B text-to-speech weights, which are a
  different artifact from Microsoft's current ASR-7B model. Those weights
  are not included here. Do not treat them as MIT-licensed.

- Audio, episodes, voice-reference clips, books, or model weights. None of
  those are included in this repository.
